    "text": {
      "en": "Start with Vienna’s old centre, then choose between palace rooms, art collections and market streets. For a short stay, give each day one main visit and leave room for cafés and walking. Schönbrunn is a separate outing, not another stop beside Stephansplatz."
    }
  },
