        "en": "St Stephen’s Cathedral"
      },
      "kind": "religious-site",
      "shortDescription": {
        "en": "The cathedral anchors Stephansplatz in the old centre. Start outside to take in the patterned roof and the surrounding streets."
      },
      "bookingAdvice": {
        "en": "Check access separately for the church, towers and guided visits; worship and visitor access are different."
